#. [unit_type]: id=Dwarvish Masked Guardsman, race=dwarf
#. [unit_type]: id=Dwarvish Guardsman, race=dwarf
#: data/campaigns/The_Hammer_of_Thursagan/units/Dwarvish_Masked_Guardsman.cfg:17
#: data/core/units/dwarves/Guardsman.cfg:17
msgid ""
"The dwarven race has always been famed for its sturdiness of build, and many "
"of their warriors outfit themselves to take advantage of this. Dwarven "
"guardsmen march into battle with tower shields and spears. Most often, their "
"role is to hold the line, and to take a heavy toll on those who try to break "
"it. As the line marches forward, they act to secure its hard-won advance."
msgstr "드워프 종족은 언제나 튼튼한 체격으로 유명했고, 많은 전사들이 이를 활용하도록 장비를 갖춥니다. 드워프 경비병은 타워 실드와 창을 들고 전투에 나섭니다. 이들의 주된 역할은 전선을 지키고 이를 돌파하려는 적에게 큰 피해를 입히는 것입니다. 전선이 전진할 때는 어렵게 얻은 진격을 굳힙니다."

